{"id":"360cd416ab61de6f","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-choquet.md","title":"Choquet Generic","display":"df-choquet — Choquet Generic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-choquet","aliases":["58-df-choquet"],"display":"df-choquet — Choquet Generic","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-choquet"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-choquet</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-choquet — Choquet Generic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P)\">\\((P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (偏序, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (偏序谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\subseteq P\">\\(G \\subseteq P\\)</span> (候选 generic 集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega\\)</span> (指定的稠密集序列)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChoquetGeneric}(G,P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChoquetGeneric}(G,P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D)\\)</span> (countable-family genericity predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choquet} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChoquetGeneric}(G,P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\land\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathcal D(n)\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\land G\\cap\\mathcal D(n)\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choquet} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChoquetGeneric}(G,P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\land\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathcal D(n)\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\land G\\cap\\mathcal D(n)\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The intersections may be witnessed by different conditions of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>; no single condition need lie in every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D(n)\">\\(\\mathcal D(n)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This countable-family forcing notion is distinct from the topological Choquet game.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(P,\\leq_P)$ (偏序, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)$ (偏序谓词, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)$ (filter predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"G \\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChoquetGeneric}(G,P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choquet} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChoquetGeneric}(G,P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land G\\subseteq P\\land\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal P(P)^\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathcal D(n)\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\land G\\cap\\mathcal D(n)\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1327,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-276","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-choquet.md|58-df-choquet]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["545853811ce0a4b6","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}